          "content": "**Page no. 64**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.121,
            0.799,
            0.139
          ],
          "content": "**Q. Try and find out all possible times on a 12-hour clock of each of these types.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.139,
            0.794,
            0.192
          ],
          "content": "| Ans. | 4:44 | 2:22 | 3:33 |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | 10:10 | 11:11 | 12:12 | 09:09 |\n| 12:21 |  | 05:50 | 10:01 | Think of some more! |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_26_table_3.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.209,
            0.571,
            0.227
          ],
          "content": "**Q. Find some other dates of this form from the past.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.227,
            0.622,
            0.245
          ],
          "content": "Ans. 20/04/2004, 20/06/2006, Try for yourself!"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.263,
            0.57,
            0.28
          ],
          "content": "**Q. Find all possible dates of this form from the past.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.28,
            0.657,
            0.298
          ],
          "content": "Ans. 01/02/2001, 02/02/2002, Think of some more!"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.315,
            0.881,
            0.351
          ],
          "content": "**Q. Will any year’s calendar repeat again after some years? Will all dates and days in a year match exactly with that of another year?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.352,
            0.221,
            0.368
          ],
          "content": "Ans. Yes,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.369,
            0.881,
            0.405
          ],
          "content": "The calendar repeats itself after 6 years if only one leap year is included in these 6 years. If 2 leap years are included, then it will repeat after 5 years."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.44,
            0.223,
            0.456
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Page no. 64"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.455,
            0.149,
            0.475
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_26_image_12.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.477,
            0.233,
            0.493
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Figure it out"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.494,
            0.883,
            0.563
          ],
          "content": "**Q.1. Pratibha uses the digits ‘4’, ‘7’, ‘3’ and ‘2’, and makes the smallest and largest 4- digit numbers with them: 2347 and 7432. The difference between these two numbers is 7432 – 2347 = 5085. The sum of these two numbers is 9779. Choose 4– digits to make:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.564,
            0.848,
            0.581
          ],
          "content": "**a. the difference between the largest and smallest numbers greater than 5085.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.583,
            0.818,
            0.599
          ],
          "content": "**b. the difference between the largest and smallest numbers less than 5085.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.6,
            0.744,
            0.617
          ],
          "content": "**c. the sum of the largest and smallest numbers greater than 9779.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.618,
            0.713,
            0.635
          ],
          "content": "**d. the sum of the largest and smallest numbers less than 9779.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.636,
            0.424,
            0.652
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** Some of the possibilities are–"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.212,
            0.654,
            0.402,
            0.67
          ],
          "content": "a. 7431 – 1347 = 6084"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.212,
            0.671,
            0.404,
            0.687
          ],
          "content": "b. 7433 – 3347 = 4086"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.212,
            0.689,
            0.413,
            0.705
          ],
          "content": "c. 7433 + 3347 = 10780"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.212,
            0.706,
            0.405,
            0.723
          ],
          "content": "d. $7 4 3 1 + 1 3 4 7 = 8 7 7 8$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.741,
            0.881,
            0.775
          ],
          "content": "**Q.2. What is the sum of the smallest and largest 5-digit palindrome? What is their difference?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.777,
            0.49,
            0.848
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** Smallest 5 digit palindrome = 10001 largest 5 digit palindrome = 99999 Sum = 10001 + 99999 = 110,000 Difference = 99999 – 10001 = 89,998"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
